        "INFOPLIST_KEY_NSHumanReadableCopyright": "© Copyright 2024-2026, Andre Trettin",
        "INFOPLIST_KEY_NSLocalNetworkUsageDescription": "MasterRPG uses the local network to connect with other player around you to share maps from the GameMaster",
